595
00:44:18,960 --> 00:44:20,579
I also have to thank you, Commander Mou.

596
00:44:23,539 --> 00:44:24,320
If it weren't for you

597
00:44:24,320 --> 00:44:26,280
pulling me out of the black prison,

598
00:44:27,719 --> 00:44:29,199
how would I, Jiang Xuting,

599
00:44:30,739 --> 00:44:32,860
end up like this?

600
00:44:33,239 --> 00:44:34,320
A man

601
00:44:34,860 --> 00:44:36,739
who's not quite human or ghost.

602
00:44:49,079 --> 00:44:50,380
Why are you like this?

603
00:44:56,139 --> 00:44:57,980
Do you think I really don't know

604
00:44:59,199 --> 00:45:01,139
who did this to my leg?

605
00:45:02,440 --> 00:45:03,699
You're indeed brilliant.

606
00:45:03,699 --> 00:45:05,659
Jiang Xueting follows your every command,

607
00:45:05,760 --> 00:45:07,179
even more obedient than a well-trained dog.

608
00:45:08,059 --> 00:45:09,360
He is consumed by hatred,

609
00:45:09,920 --> 00:45:11,820
determined to seek revenge on Yu Changxuan.

610
00:45:12,619 --> 00:45:14,019
He's just the tool I need.

611
00:45:14,719 --> 00:45:16,219
If one day he becomes disobedient,

612
00:45:17,599 --> 00:45:19,420
and bares his teeth at his master,

613
00:45:20,639 --> 00:45:22,320
I will personally kill him.

614
00:45:24,199 --> 00:45:25,659
Have you never considered

615
00:45:26,820 --> 00:45:30,900
that the dog you've raised is constantly looking for an opportunity

616
00:45:32,159 --> 00:45:34,659
to bite off your neck?

617
00:46:26,719 --> 00:46:28,239
Do as I say.

618
00:46:28,940 --> 00:46:29,500
Yes, sir.

619
00:46:50,960 --> 00:46:51,840
Welcome, My Lord.
